join ember (normal) right [animation="Fade In"]
ember: Hello! Welcome to this place!
ember: What brings you here?
[wait time="0.1"]
- You!
	ember: Aww. That's so cute! (+30 Charm)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":30}"]
- I'm here to be with someone very special...
	ember: Hmmm, I wonder who... (+30 Wit)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":30}"]
- I want to defend you.
	ember: That's great to hear. I trust that you will do a great job. (+30 Trust)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":30}"]
ember: Better get onto defending then...
do GameManager.end_dialauge()